    <data key="d0">ZS Self-Service Enterprise Data Engineering Platform</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JG5p-i8Cr2E</data>
    <data key="d2">Self-service data engineering platform enabling automated infrastructure provisioning and data access governance with fine-grained access controls and automated resource lifecycle management.</data>
